description = "Freedom comes hard for most ponygirls - years of training make it hard to pick up a normal life, and keeps them yearning for the strong hand of their former master. But it's not just psychological changes that linger:
Former ponygirls keep producing milk for another couple of years. At first this can be used to feed their young, but later it means they need to be milked.
Thanks to the constant exposure to goblin cum they are healthy, strong and very beautiful - the famous ponygirl glow.
Ponygirls have a drastically enhanced libido and are still addicted to goblin cum. The latter will ease off after a couple of months, the former takes years to go away.
Most retired ponygirls keep a very meek and submissive persona, and while it may sound controversial, start to miss their times as ponygirls - probably thanks to a mix of conditioning and the drug-like properties of Goblin cum.
After recovering they typically gravitate towards strict and dominant partners (which also become their owner to control the womb tattoo), and are considered extremely fertile, often mothering many healthy children.

— Excerpt from “Ponygirls of the Borderlands: An Essay on Goblins and Their Mounts,” by Scholar Lula of Trisa Academy"
